   "title": "Scientists identify two ages when children may be most vulnerable to screen time",
   "snippet": "Scientists have identified two potentially critical periods when screen time may be especially detrimental to children's learning and memory: infancy and the start of formal schooling. Greater screen exposure during these developmental windows was linked to poorer academic performance and weaker working memory years later.",
   "published_at": null,
   "found_at": "2026-11-27T06:09:43Z",
