   "canonical_url": "https://sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/11/261125045311.htm",
   "title": "This dietary supplement may have an unexpected benefit for the brain",
   "snippet": "A naturally derived dietary supplement called urolithin A may help the brain get more oxygen and nutrients when it needs them most. In a randomized clinical trial involving 50 middle-aged adults with obesity, researchers found that taking the supplement daily for four weeks increased blood flow to the brain during a challenging memory task, particularly in a region involved in working memory.",
   "published_at": null,
   "found_at": "2026-11-27T06:09:43Z",
